  title: The Oskars
  headliner: '<b>HOLLYWOOD MEETS METRO MANILA: THE OSKARS HIT NEW MANILA THEATRE
    TOMORROW</b>'
  bodyText: Red carpets are rolling out across the district as the prestigious Oskars
    award ceremony makes its official debut at the New Manila Theatre tomorrow evening.
    Local authorities are bracing for massive traffic bottlenecks, a wall-to-wall
    fleet of stretch limousines, and an influx of glammed-up nominees all desperate
    to take home the coveted golden statuette.
